<title>USA: ARI Network Services trims Q2 Jan 31 loss.</title>
<headline>ARI Network Services trims Q2 Jan 31 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARI Network Services Inc said Wednesday higher revenues in the second quarter ended January 31 helped the company's losses narrow from one year ago.</p>
<p>The company said it lost $931,000, or $0.06 a share, compared to $1.2 million, or $0.10 a share, in 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues in the period grew to $1.7 million from $1.1 million, the company reported.</p>
<p>ARI Network Services provides electronic commerce services on the Internet to a variety of industries.</p>
<p>Its shares closed up 1/8 Wednesday at 2-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
